  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Saves Lives project in Battambang and Banteay Mean Chey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a three-year project that seeks to improve food security of rural communities living in Battambang and Banteay Mean Chey province through increased access to and sound management of water for small-scale agriculture, biodiversity conversation, and improved sanitation and hygiene. The project will strengthen capacity of community based water resource management in order to increase access of rural communities to water consumption and sustainably manage water for their livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
